Package: what-changed-watcher
Version: 0.1.1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-pymysql, php-cli, apache2, mariadb-client
Maintainer: WhatChanged Alpha <alpha@whatchanged.invalid>
Description: Read-only FreePBX pending-change observer
 WhatChanged observes a bounded set of FreePBX configuration records and
 watched files. It does not apply configuration, reload Asterisk, or modify
 FreePBX configuration.
